I am Shaoyi "Yee" Lai, a Ph.D. student in Political Science at the School of Economic, Political, and Policy Sciences ([EPPS](https://epps.utdallas.edu/)), [the University of Texas at Dallas](https://www.utdallas.edu/).  

My research interests include international security, U.S.–China relations, Taiwan affairs, and the political economy of emerging technologies, with particular attention to information operations and strategic competition.

Welcome to my website, where I share my research, publications, ongoing projects, and other stuff.

💡"[lí-hó](https://itaigi.tw/k/你好/你好/lí hó)" means "Howdy," and "[tsiah-pá--buē](https://itaigi.tw/k/食飽未/食飽未/tsia̍h-pá--buē)" means "Jee tyet?"


